# build-dns-query for "example.com" A record:
# Header(12) + QNAME(13) + QTYPE(2) + QCLASS(2) = 29 bytes.
#
# QNAME breakdown: chr(7)+"example"+chr(3)+"com"+chr(0)
#   = 8 + 4 + 1 = 13 bytes.

[include %libdir "protocols/dns.llt"]
---
[length [call %.build-dns-query 1 "example.com" %.A]]
=== out
Int(29)
